WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.605
Here we have a simple aggregate The query groups
survey responses

00:00:05.632 --> 00:00:11.697
by question and calculates the number of responses
and the average score Run

00:00:11.723 --> 00:00:18.859
it in the browser and check the grain One output row
represents one question In

00:00:18.885 --> 00:00:23.780
Spark SQL the same grouping idea would apply but the
data could be distributed across

00:00:23.793 --> 00:00:24.819
many partitions
